  "description": "HybridKV: Hybrid KV Cache Compression for Multimodal & Long-Context LLMs. Classifies attention heads into static/dynamic types and applies distinct compression strategies per type under a hierarchical budget strictly to dynamic KV caches.  Paper: \"HybridKV: Hybrid KV Cache Compression for Efficient MLLM Inference\"        Zeng et al., arXiv:2604.05887. Registered as 'hybridkv'.",
